  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Enemies that begin their turn or move within the threatened area of a dancer suffer 1d6 points of bludgeoning damage and become battered for 1 round. A successful Reflex save negates this damage and the battered condition; a creature may only be damaged once per turn in this way.</p>\n<p>A dancer can spend an immediate action whenever an enemy would suffer this damage to add an additional die of damage to the total, plus an additional die for every 5 ranks in this package’s associated skill you possess; in addition to a successful save not negating the battered condition.</p>\n<p>At 10 ranks in this package’s associated skill, the damage die dealt increases to d8s, and a successful save only halves the damage dealt.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/performance#toc32\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
